      "hash": "2330131b5d9793d4023783aeceb087c7880f12ec9aeb2d9334466709764226a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba3453ef4794e395a5c7295a61eb6d7c112262f9763663e0cfc9bb2d48dd62ca",
      "text": "Attention budget",
      "hash": "3050c3ed0aa7f513c8d6d6891433e8d97ad0fbe382486b1f5b52a1129c834ab1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5dfb8a5ed69e316d854546ff7593ac242b66e3a5a9fe66c84b28326b1816f8f1",
      "text": "Each token has a finite amount of influence to distribute across the rest of the context. Per-token, doesn't grow when context does.",
      "hash": "062efecad3133d1776bbc810917fb38cc6128b3fd57eeeae7e63c8a00db57f99"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d01b800213dc97b67f5c3ed989a7c5c0b00a1a038adb685d9d26bbe17b9c1c4",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "f03603968c68d47df846247da8fece6e67b2ffaea0188ea3ea9dc7cff9b4b5be",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "94bdfa5153ebe61154778205fdbdb102b13095a7f467dfdc260f39ebb2ec2432",
      "text": "Each",
      "hash": "a9531f64027967a038d348e7a9cd626d4938661f425667f88c1b7cc9d1b69b15"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9ee6929cdd7b86fcc4bf67cc0d29134fb29f69a3976837c403d6d139556dbaf",
      "text": "has a finite amount of influence to distribute across the rest of the",
      "hash": "91836b849531c26b66088b10e495ef3546912190561f7aad34f5664c9d27b7e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a6d65d9bbbc4d474394b39571c95e614f80bc517e4f81104c0c9ed55ad7f647",
      "text": ". Heavy influence on",
      "hash": "4ccceb30e3dedf33a09d2485b229870a61ddd416f96af40c206244117109f5c4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac4ffdc51a38d31453cbe9dab5917ccc7fdf8d58586e6baf144162cc6cbf9de2",
      "text": "one relationship",
      "hash": "35028263ab8a3b8e8e7114d191189aab53520eb09c182a6cca3cd45189b59b70"
    },
    {
      "id": "be05d85994ee417a93474c2e252cdc7fcba462f5ca6d0cd946d4480a11a2d3af",
      "text": "leaves less for others. The budget is per-token and doesn't grow when the context does, which is why long",
      "hash": "031a22c2296de208b0cd99900bcc86951eb56e8269c276cae78362e38041c16e"
    },
    {
      "id": "a239705036f44f16fa89110fcd18a0704d03e6b85a089b517bf9a0ce53774c30",
      "text": "dilute.",
      "hash": "63ac25442684eaa73bbaf7b74334462dfe0f7ad3464d9a68d9f8300c35d4672c"
    },
    {
      "id": "98dc14e2308f3fafb823dc4557e12116351ec41a1f00d65cc610b1d32065bde9",
      "text": "Think of it as signal and noise. Your instruction is a signal at fixed volume; every other token in the",
      "hash": "6f5cb75cc99706eedb93241e32d13734d5335d48f8705e7ece3a7c95761a1520"
    },
    {
      "id": "af15b09efd534fd20139e19e8478aa373645162887fa80d9134d648d89fd1113",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0ed500b1f326f6d82dea5f76d658b664398834cba3f6d99393b9eef8a6fdc91",
      "text": "is competing sound. The instruction never gets quieter — it's still there, character for character — but as the context grows, the room gets louder around it, and the signal-to-noise ratio drops. An instruction that was the loudest thing at 10k tokens of context is background hum at 150k. This is the mechanism behind",
      "hash": "cf6db3029bba9621259b86e3bd46cf16832ad53d32ac3c4ce88aad62793b0879"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07c95d7d0797c1bfe6a770fcc957dc2ba2e92d1898de06877c3b2faf658379d",
      "text": "attention degradation",
      "hash": "79e5ddec1498a24115fe8cb565695632f5d9c71beafb43cd0a04d319ef44230f"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba01230fe8cda39284cae4166442c075465e8847fa8a87ed1554f5196e876d43",
      "text": ": the model doesn't forget; the signal gets lost in the noise.",
      "hash": "05532d6236564bec21054b6a1b54838dee2d5c357334841f56883a41e5a467d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "86a3de1cb1d929385f25af3c47a81a2fec94a0e6e3b2cf6cf72e80849d75dcd2",
      "text": "The symptom reads as disobedience — the agent agreed to a constraint early on and then drifts from it, and re-pasting the constraint helps only briefly. The cause isn't the instruction; it's everything else in the window competing with it.",
      "hash": "1cdd3dc40a5a978331b47071565b5255fb405dd87788249173d2a34971a2083e"
    },
    {
      "id": "b893a6e98357677d495db49765fd6cd1811d9a8fc8d0cbb6273a9c43ed20479c",
      "text": "What you can control is what goes into the context. Content that doesn't serve the task isn't neutral — it's noise over everything that does. Keep the window small,",
      "hash": "0d3ee92e026bb3b0921318278bb4ad288a54448fe4756a733a2b7cefecb8f31c"
    },
    {
      "id": "aba66755cf4faf6239f138d1d157ee43d3e6af7ab4e777d34294eda73ec73e0f",
      "text": "when the accumulated context stops paying for itself, and restate the constraints that matter instead of trusting their early mention to hold.",
      "hash": "1b55da0baac38f7a84a1bec7b87d37bb7496196ff1bf2ecd9cb8abe8b6182b3b"
    },
    {
      "id": "88bde2d5cae36e529d5b3aa3b194cbd4b047bd51c93a1eed914aaa54d0ae9de8",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "521b70132a5792db14ee2fdb3b1e39030478a2246a509101617cc252a86577ec",
      "text": "\"Why does it keep ignoring the schema I pasted at the top?\"",
      "hash": "b8abe1483cbeeebd31e3246b3b3b70a1dcde6e8e916c254d7196988b4a082ced"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc74ed218f65ebca783148f74c548a55560b91c1592f1dd2eb23691b609b295b",
      "text": "\"We're well into the",
      "hash": "4aacb8ff1e88d80d501f7c011de09cdad67c175b0e9560ba0edd77ee45fd733c"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f7dc9f67d0e808748ee4f21053bb2d03fc4925d30d0cab565720ef7ddb2480a",
      "text": "dumb zone",
      "hash": "d1f4ef2612da4453aa6dc92c0023b63f3efd20345f0715a9e437d9a08a5dbb8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "6872ed8ee44371f4d50660bedf4fd19201adf907b1968d667404badae4796531",
      "text": "— every token's attention budget is fixed, but the context kept growing. The signal on the schema is now competing with thousands of newer tokens.\"",
      "hash": "e681a01e37cab85fd84e551012bf7d6ae2f380f528006f80427f3310c08a02a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "1f541b4c91a7c66fd19400c18ac5e63a8c9209e5dab1502da430465958c2595d",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a6908ff5569db50a20e6cb8c2f9c7b063c4a0fa2540ee234053feddb50b48eb",
      "text": "Attention relationship",
      "hash": "3326352af9343a5dd603549ddc399a87efaec24216defa5bbbf745688a6eb302"
    },
    {
      "id": "4729251f2d9250dba234b3ec2485efdef5658aaabd90b4c3491a2cec4aa82b65",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8aeffb8ce3a314273763883d933ba09f26dc0b2778a7202c2074a6feff18c63",
      "text": "Attention degradation",
      "hash": "892a19ca52d75c31194b0b4d50bdbdc67fcce95b1420c662633dbdda562252f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0bd905ea64e4b1ec6c60ad7de46acae6d0ca98a8ed24035f0114ec3772d178f",
